    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Poultry farming is rapidly emerging as a promising and sustainable venture for small-scale farmers across Africa. The pathway to turning this potential into profit was recently unlocked for 26 aspiring entrepreneurs - 22 women and four men - during a high-impact training session held at AKU's Community Outreach Centre, Arusha in September 2025.",
